  "description": "Mobile 390x844 portrait, DPR 3, touch, R-27: keyboard-only traversal of the guest UI as it first loads. Presses Tab 30 times and then Shift+Tab 4 times, and after each press reads the focused element (its tag, role, accessible label, states, whether it matches :focus-visible, its outline, box shadow and box) and every live region (role, politeness, text length); it captures the view after the 1st, 4th, 8th, 12th and 20th Tab and the last Shift+Tab. It presses no Enter or Space and sends no touch, so nothing is activated and a focused link is never followed. Escape at the end, then one more read, the scene and the app state. The keyboard stands in for an external one. Runs right after 09 in a fresh session.",
